{
  "_comment": "Expected outcome of a foreground (real SpringBoard launch) Run All of the embedded ShadowHarness under aggressive mode. Regenerate with: tests/harness-regression.py --update after a verified-clean device run. Each detector must report outcome=clean; notChecked lists the exact check ids allowed to pass by being marked notChecked (a harness artifact or opt-in diagnostic) rather than by a real hook. A NEW notChecked id, or a real check flipping to fail, is a regression.",
